theorem_text:
Let $D$ be the determinant:
$D = \begin {vmatrix}
      1 &       0 & \cdots &       0 \\
b_{2 1} & b_{2 2} & \cdots & b_{2 n} \\
 \vdots &  \vdots & \ddots &  \vdots \\
b_{n 1} & b_{n 2} & \cdots & b_{n n}
\end {vmatrix}$
Then:
$D = \begin {vmatrix}
b_{2 2} & \cdots & b_{2 n} \\
 \vdots & \ddots &  \vdots \\
b_{n 2} & \cdots & b_{n n}
\end {vmatrix}$
